WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.044 --> 00:00:05.338
I have secrets

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:08.049
that not even my friends
or family know about

00:00:09.551 --> 00:00:12.637
who who could possibly find out.

00:00:12.637 --> 00:00:14.681
I mean, I've come so far.

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:17.350
Six years of architecture school,
three years of internship.

00:00:17.892 --> 00:00:20.812
Nobody's ever going to find out.

00:00:21.104 --> 00:00:24.232
That I'm a fraud.

00:00:25.066 --> 00:00:27.777
No, you need to stop talking like that.

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:30.530
Who needs math anyways?

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:32.532
I can be a good architect
without being good at math.

00:00:33.908 --> 00:00:34.451
Right?

